      "content": "hey i think something is wrong with my luminight bulbs. they keep doing this weird rapid flickering thing for like like 2 seconds every time i'm on a call. it feels way too patterned to be a driver issue or something. is it possible they're using the light frequency to transmit data or something? i'm getting really paranoid about my privacy",
