      "content": "rfi is possible but the timing is what's killing me... it literally only happens when i start talking. like the second i unmute, the flicker starts. it's almost like the bulbs are reacting to the sound waves or the data being sent out. it feels way more deliberate than just some random wifi interference. do you think it's possible they've integrated some kind of acoustic sensing into the hardware that uses the LED pulses to heartbeat the data back to a server?",
